                        "sense_id": "faee1cb5-f2d3-3b57-af3d-c4477464c9f4",
                        "entry_id": "0cffb2f8-2add-367e-8b2a-9cffddc5974f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Similar in shape to blobs; amorphous and rounded in appearance; partially irregular in appearance like bubbles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a052942a-0d6e-43e0-a69c-9d1b197b307c",
                                "sense_id": "faee1cb5-f2d3-3b57-af3d-c4477464c9f4",
                                "text": "They were of all sizes, from little gnomes barely a foot high to stately figures taller than men. […] There were long, pointed noses, and long, soft noses like small trunks, and great blobby noses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "52c275d8-5f02-4d1e-b033-fb53843e7f15",
                                "sense_id": "faee1cb5-f2d3-3b57-af3d-c4477464c9f4",
                                "text": "The magnitude of the attraction force of blobby elements is usually defined by their volume […] In an animation, blobby surfaces are dynamic and constantly regenerate as they move in and out […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea4d60ed-aa23-4c5b-a765-3da4d617e253",
                                "sense_id": "faee1cb5-f2d3-3b57-af3d-c4477464c9f4",
                                "text": "The orchestra is gone. All seventy of them. The things which have replaced them are not human but alien, ill-proportioned pillars of pinkish-brownish flesh. Each has, at its top, a heavy protuberance studded with goopy biological sensors and rubbery openings, and, sprouting from the very cap, lengths of various kinds of vile, off-coloured moss. They are draped in black and white fabrics, weirdly cut to either conceal or highlight their blobby, inconsistent body structures."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
